      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am worried that we will drop other status on the floor here since the tcpci_tcpc_alert function isn\u0027t getting a chance to process those statuses.\n\nCan we some out get this informaiton from TCPCI layer via tcpci_tcpc_alert so all the other status can be handle as well?",
