      "writtenOn": "2020-02-11T21:25:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Speaking from personal experience, we do get an interrupt on a fault (if you don\u0027t believe me, code your i2c interactions wrong and see all the i2c errors pour in ;) )\n\nThis appears to be checking for any fault though?  Not any specific bit that had been set in the FAULT_STATUS register?",
      "parentUuid": "004a67ce_95de939f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 218,
        "startChar": 2,
